Exodus	Ex	2	12	5	And it shall be a lamb without blemish, a male, of one year: according to which rite also you shall take a kid.
Exodus	Ex	2	12	6	And you shall keep it until the fourteenth day of this month: and the whole multitude of the children of Israel shall sacrifice it in the evening.
